        "audienceVibe": "Reflective, slightly fatigued from data-heavy sessions, ready for a grounded, high-stakes human story that earns a standing ovation.",
        "bridgeIn": "Picture a Tuesday morning in Toledo, Ohio, at five-forty in the dark, when a woman with a rolling briefcase stepped out of a rental car and smelled cutting oil before she even reached the factory door.",
        "bridgeOut": "The next time someone hands you a binder and asks you to sign off on a problem you have never stood inside, remember the chalk line on Bay Four.",
        "avoidWhen": "Avoid when the event is a light-hearted awards banquet or when the audience has just experienced a real-world workplace tragedy."
