        "audienceVibe": "Reflective, slightly fatigued from a full day of slides and frameworks, ready for a human story that rewards patience and lands with quiet moral weight.",
        "bridgeIn": "Think back to what unfolded in a fluorescent-lit testing lab in Columbus, Ohio, one November afternoon\u2014when a structural designer named Nadia Okafor realized that every chart on her wall was lying to her.",
        "bridgeOut": "The next time the data says the problem is solved, ask yourself one question: have you ridden the four o'clock axle yet?",
