        "bridgeIn": "Think about what happened in a stamping plant in Toledo, Ohio, on a freezing Tuesday morning in November, when a woman with a scuffed clipboard walked onto a floor that had already decided she did not belong there.",
        "bridgeOut": "Real authority never comes from the binder in your hand. It comes from the moment you set the binder down and ask what the person across from you is carrying.",
