        "bridgeIn": "Think about what happens in the final hour before a storm closes the sky, when someone has to decide whether a single trip is worth the risk. In May 2019, in northern Ontario, a bush pilot named Claire Bouchard stood on a rain-slicked dock with forty pounds of cargo and nowhere else to look.",
